Dear Emilie,

Thanks, I may have found a fix for it. Would you mind trying it out by installing the GGIR development version via the following code in the R console?

install.packages("remotes");
library(remotes);
remotes::install_github("wadpac/GGIR", ref  = "issue534_temp_col_adhoccsv");
library(GGIR)

Thanks,
