Hi Nathaniel,

In Omgui, you can go to the options tab at the top and change the filename structure so that it includes the subject code e.g. {SubjectCode}_{SerialNumber}.....

If you do this with subject code at the start as per my example then you can just use idloc=1 in GGIR when processing the data and the outputs will have the subject code as the ID.

Kind regards,
Ben

kind regards,
