> > > > > > > > > > install.packages("remotes")
> > > > > > > > > > remotes::install_github("wadpac/GGIR", ref= "issue504_handling_invalid_sleeplog_entries")
> > > > > > > > > > library(GGIR)
> > > > > > > > > >
> > > > > > > > > > Thanks,
> > > > > > > > > > Vincent
